<SiteLayout title="Right of Withdrawal | Badestrand Kosmetik" current="widerruf" description="Withdrawal information from Badestrand Kosmetik GmbH for consumers.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Legal</div><h1>Right of Withdrawal</h1></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container legal-content">
  <div class="legal-notice"><strong>In preparation:</strong> The final withdrawal notice and the downloadable model withdrawal form are currently being reviewed with our legal counsel and will be published here before shop launch.</div>
  <h2>Right of Withdrawal</h2>
  <p>Consumers generally have a statutory right of withdrawal for distance contracts. The exact withdrawal period, conditions and consequences of withdrawal will be published here in full after legal review.</p>
  <h2>Exercising the Right of Withdrawal</h2>
  <p>To exercise your right of withdrawal, you will be able to contact us using the details listed in our <a href="/en/impressum/">Legal Notice</a> once this page is finalized.</p>
  <h2>Model Withdrawal Form</h2>
  <p>A downloadable model withdrawal form will be provided here.</p>
  <h2>Exclusion / Early Expiry of the Right of Withdrawal</h2>
  <p>For sealed cosmetic products that are not suitable for return for reasons of health protection or hygiene and whose seal has been removed after delivery, the right of withdrawal may expire early. Details will follow after legal review.</p>
</div></section>
</SiteLayout>
